OL,3,GNEWSAStudent places doubled for new
OL,4,ASEND school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new school for children with special
OL,7,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,8,F(SEND) has been given the go-ahead with
OL,9,Ftwice the number of places than
OL,10,Foriginally planned.
OL,12,FSecretary of State for Education Lucy
OL,13,FPowell approved plans for the Garden
OL,14,FVillage Free School in Darlington,
OL,15,Fwhich will cater for students with
OL,16,Fautism spectrum disorder.
OL,18,FOriginally designed to serve 48 pupils,
OL,19,Fthe Department for Education (DfE) has
OL,20,Fagreed to double provision for 11 to
OL,21,F19-year-olds to meet local need.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
