OL,3,GNEWSAStudent places doubled for new
OL,4,ASEND school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe facility will be built on land
OL,7,Fowned by Darlington Borough Council as
OL,8,Fpart of the Education Village Academy
OL,9,FTrust (EVAT). The trust said the school
OL,10,Fwould provide an "inspirational
OL,11,Flearning environment" for pupils.
